<%- include('partials/header') %><section class="page-hero compact"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow eyebrow-accent">Structured service request</span><h1>Book a professional home service</h1><p>Complete five short steps. Your request will begin with the status “New.”</p></div></section><section class="section booking-section"><div class="container booking-layout"><div class="booking-main"><div class="progress" aria-label="Booking progress"><div class="progress-line"><span></span></div><button type="button" class="progress-step active" data-step-target="1"><b>1</b><span>Service</span></button><button type="button" class="progress-step" data-step-target="2"><b>2</b><span>Problem</span></button><button type="button" class="progress-step" data-step-target="3"><b>3</b><span>Details</span></button><button type="button" class="progress-step" data-step-target="4"><b>4</b><span>Schedule</span></button><button type="button" class="progress-step" data-step-target="5"><b>5</b><span>Review</span></button></div><% if(errors.form){ %><div class="form-error-banner"><%= errors.form %></div><% } %><form id="booking-form" method="post" action="/book" novalidate><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><input type="hidden" name="submission_token" value="<%= bookingToken %>"><fieldset class="booking-step active" data-step="1"><legend><span class="eyebrow">Step 1 of 5</span>Select a service</legend><p>Choose the option that best matches your needs.</p><div class="service-options"><% services.forEach(s=>{ %><label class="service-option"><input type="radio" name="service_id" value="<%= s.id %>" <%= Number(values.service_id||selected)===s.id?'checked':'' %> required><img src="<%= s.image %>" alt="" width="112" height="80"><span><small><%= s.category_name %></small><strong><%= s.name %></strong><em>From <%= h.formatINR(s.starting_price) %> · <%= s.duration %></em></span><b>✓</b></label><% }) %></div><% if(errors.service_id){ %><span class="field-error"><%= errors.service_id %></span><% } %></fieldset><fieldset class="booking-step" data-step="2"><legend><span class="eyebrow">Step 2 of 5</span>Describe the problem</legend><p>Clear details help the administrator prepare the right response.</p><label class="field"><span>What needs attention? <em>*</em></span><textarea name="problem" rows="7" minlength="15" maxlength="2000" required placeholder="Example: The AC is running but not cooling effectively. The indoor unit was last serviced about one year ago."><%= values.problem||'' %></textarea><small>At least 15 characters. Include make, model or symptoms where relevant.</small><% if(errors.problem){ %><span class="field-error"><%= errors.problem %></span><% } %></label></fieldset><fieldset class="booking-step" data-step="3"><legend><span class="eyebrow">Step 3 of 5</span>Your contact and address</legend><p>We use these details only to manage this service request.</p><div class="form-grid"><label class="field"><span>Full name <em>*</em></span><input name="customer_name" value="<%= values.customer_name||profile.name||'' %>" autocomplete="name" required><% if(errors.customer_name){ %><span class="field-error"><%= errors.customer_name %></span><% } %></label><label class="field"><span>Mobile number <em>*</em></span><input name="phone" value="<%= values.phone||profile.phone||'' %>" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[6-9][0-9]{9}" maxlength="10" autocomplete="tel" required><small>10-digit Indian mobile number</small><% if(errors.phone){ %><span class="field-error"><%= errors.phone %></span><% } %></label><label class="field full"><span>Email address <small>(optional)</small></span><input type="email" name="email" value="<%= values.email||profile.email||'' %>" autocomplete="email"><% if(errors.email){ %><span class="field-error"><%= errors.email %></span><% } %></label><label class="field"><span>House or building <em>*</em></span><input name="building" value="<%= values.building||profile.building||'' %>" autocomplete="address-line1" required><% if(errors.building){ %><span class="field-error"><%= errors.building %></span><% } %></label><label class="field"><span>Street address <em>*</em></span><input name="street" value="<%= values.street||profile.street||'' %>" autocomplete="address-line2" required><% if(errors.street){ %><span class="field-error"><%= errors.street %></span><% } %></label><label class="field"><span>City <em>*</em></span><input name="city" value="<%= values.city||profile.city||'' %>" autocomplete="address-level2" required><% if(errors.city){ %><span class="field-error"><%= errors.city %></span><% } %></label><label class="field"><span>State <em>*</em></span><input name="state" value="<%= values.state||profile.state||'' %>" autocomplete="address-level1" required><% if(errors.state){ %><span class="field-error"><%= errors.state %></span><% } %></label><label class="field"><span>PIN code <em>*</em></span><input name="pincode" value="<%= values.pincode||profile.pincode||'' %>" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{6}" maxlength="6" autocomplete="postal-code" required><% if(errors.pincode){ %><span class="field-error"><%= errors.pincode %></span><% } %></label></div></fieldset><fieldset class="booking-step" data-step="4"><legend><span class="eyebrow">Step 4 of 5</span>Choose a preferred appointment</legend><p>This is a preference, not a confirmed appointment.</p><div class="form-grid"><label class="field"><span>Preferred date <em>*</em></span><input type="date" name="appointment_date" min="<%= minDate %>" value="<%= values.appointment_date||'' %>" required><% if(errors.appointment_date){ %><span class="field-error"><%= errors.appointment_date %></span><% } %></label><label class="field"><span>Preferred time <em>*</em></span><select name="appointment_time" required><option value="">Select a time window</option><% ['09:00','10:00','11:00','12:00','14:00','15:00','16:00','17:00'].forEach(t=>{ %><option value="<%= t %>" <%= values.appointment_time===t?'selected':'' %>><%= t %></option><% }) %></select><% if(errors.appointment_time){ %><span class="field-error"><%= errors.appointment_time %></span><% } %></label></div><div class="notice"><strong>Scheduling note</strong><span>The administrator will review availability before changing the request to “Confirmed.”</span></div></fieldset><fieldset class="booking-step" data-step="5"><legend><span class="eyebrow">Step 5 of 5</span>Review and submit</legend><p>Confirm the information below before creating the request.</p><div id="booking-review" class="review-panel"></div><label class="consent"><input type="checkbox" required><span>I understand this is a service request, not a confirmed appointment or payment.</span></label><button class="button button-lg button-block submit-button" type="submit"><span>Submit service request</span><span class="button-loader"></span></button></fieldset><div class="booking-nav"><button type="button" class="button button-ghost booking-prev" hidden>← Back</button><button type="button" class="button booking-next">Continue →</button></div></form></div><aside class="booking-help"><span class="eyebrow">Need help?</span><h3>Book with confidence</h3><ul><li><span>✓</span>No online payment required</li><li><span>✓</span>Transparent quotation workflow</li><li><span>✓</span>Secure reference-based tracking</li><li><span>✓</span>Administrator-reviewed assignments</li></ul><hr><strong>Support email</strong><a href="mailto:<%= settings.business_email %>"><%= settings.business_email %></a><small>Service area: <%= settings.service_area %></small></aside></div></section><%- include('partials/footer') %>